cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Art Techno: The Gilded Circuit"
abstract: >
  Art Techno does for the computer age what Art Deco did for the machine
  age: monumental, symmetrical and luxurious, with circuit-board precision
  in place of the machine. This repository holds the style rules, the
  design boards, the 3-D models of the nine Spirits, and The Gilded
  Circuit, a walk-through 3-D plaza that runs in the browser.
